### Analytics Feature UI Routes Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/ui/analytics

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/ui/analytics
@alias = your-alias
@startDate = 2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
@endDate = 2024-12-31T23:59:59.000Z

### 1. Get URL Analytics (comprehensive - requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get Analytics Overview (summary stats - requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Get Browser Statistics (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/browsers?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Get Device Statistics (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Get Clicks Over Time (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clicks-over-time?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&groupBy=day
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Get Geographic Statistics (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/geography?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Get Referer Statistics (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/referers?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Get Hourly Statistics (requires session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hourly?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. Create Analytics Event (no session required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "{{alias}}",
  "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36",
  "ip": "192.168.1.1",
  "referer": "https://google.com",
  "country": "US",
  "city": "New York"
}

###

### 10. Get Analytics for last 7 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}&startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2024-01-07T23:59:59.000Z
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here

###

### 11. Get Clicks Over Time with different groupBy options
GET {{baseUrl}}/clicks-over-time?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&groupBy=hour
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here

###

### 12. Test without session (should fail for protected routes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}

###

### 13. Test with invalid parameters (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?invalidParam=test
Cookie: session-id=your-session-id-here

###
